# ==============================================================================
# ShopSphere Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# By default, Vite automatically uses:
#   - .env.development (http://localhost:3000/api) when running `npm run dev`
#   - .env.production  (https://shopsphere-backend-ilr1.onrender.com/api) when running `npm run build`
#
# If you want to manually force one URL for both modes, uncomment it below:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://shopsphere-backend-ilr1.onrender.com/api
